{"unit_id": "tag:03P5:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个抽象（abstract）群（group）。在任意一个景（sites）<MATH_0002>或<MATH_0003>（第<REF_0001>节）上，层化（sheafification）<MATH_0004>由与<MATH_0005>关联的常（constant）预层（presheaf）在该景（site）的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>Zariski拓扑（topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>中得到，且已经给出<MATHSEG_0001>Zariski局部（locally）常（constant）映射（maps）<MATHSEG_0002>这个Zariski层（sheaf）可由群概形（group scheme）<MATH_0006>表示（representable），见《群胚（Groupoids）》例<REF_0002>。由引理<REF_0003>，任意可表（representable）预层（presheaf）对于<MATH_0007>-拓扑（topology）也满足层条件（sheaf condition），因此我们得出，上述Zariski层化（sheafification）<MATH_0008>也是<MATH_0009>-层化（sheafification）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "abstract", "target_term": "抽象"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "constant", "target_term": "常"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "constant", "target_term": "常"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "group scheme", "target_term": "群概形"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "abstract", "target_term": "抽象", "context": "抽象群。"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群", "context": "给定的群。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "所述各景。"}, {"source_term": "constant", "target_term": "常", "context": "常预层和局部常映射。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "常预层及可表预层。"}, {"source_term": "sheafification", "target_term": "层化", "context": "不同拓扑中的层化。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "景的拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "Zariski及给定拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部", "context": "局部常映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "局部常映射。"}, {"source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "Zariski层。"}, {"source_term": "group scheme", "target_term": "群概形", "context": "表示该层的群概形。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示", "context": "群概形表示层。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "可表预层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "给定拓扑下的层条件。"}], "notes": []}
